+ * Group scheduling enhancements by Srivatsa Vaddagiri
+ * Copyright IBM Corporation, 2007
+ * Author: Srivatsa Vaddagiri <vatsa@linux.vnet.ibm.com>
+ * Scaled math optimizations by Thomas Gleixner
